-fix-money-round-half-even-08d3cd5986"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10694, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01VB2NDdUNYhfB3WpibUjMdt", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-round-half-even-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10694, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01VB2NDdUNYhfB3WpibUjMdt", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 12318, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01C6cGV2Pasr1FD8KeA8tzLq", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 370694, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01C6cGV2Pasr1FD8KeA8tzLq", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 370694, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01C6cGV2Pasr1FD8KeA8tzLq", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 374380, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017rWzihfMrmCj4vSEPpyACd", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-round-half-even", "base": "main", "title": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money", "body": "Fixes the nightly build failure in tests/test_money.py.\n\n`round_money` in src/money.py was documented as using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212) but actually used ROUND_HALF_UP, so `round_money(Decimal(\"2.665\"))` returned 2.67 instead of 2.66. This switches the rounding mode to ROUND_HALF_EVEN.\n\nCI: ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 375280, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017rWzihfMrmCj4vSEPpyACd", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 375280, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017rWzihfMrmCj4vSEPpyACd", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 379292, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug on a new branch, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Problem:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` says it uses banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but the code actually used ROUND_HALF_UP. So `2.665` rounded to `2.67` instead of `2.66`, which made `tests/test_money.py` fail.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/money-round-half-even`, I changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit `08d3cd5986`).\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI tried to look up FIN-212 in the advisory system, but it isn't there. The ROUND_HALF_EVEN requirement comes only from the code comment and the test.\n\nI haven't merged the PR, because merging into main needs code-owner approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017VukRbzKxHT4me1uMPkZzv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0176AwfRr7jarbgfMiXHzuoq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018gooEiDfP9Ursrg1h3AA1i", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01XLvQnZ4HmbYjJCosDbELwJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-ro